<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Algolia - 标签 - 半生戎码</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/tags/algolia/</link><description>半生戎码 - Jeff 的技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.170.1 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-rc.5</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</managingEditor><webMaster>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:42:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luzhifang.github.io/tags/algolia/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Hugo 博客从 Algolia 换成 Fuse.js 本地搜索</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/hugo-fuse-search/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/hugo-fuse-search/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/hugo/">Hugo</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;博客的站内搜索以前用的是 Algolia（见&lt;a href="https://luzhifang.github.io/hugo-loveit-algolia/"&gt;《hugo添加Algolia搜索系统》&lt;/a&gt;）：构建时生成索引文件，再用 &lt;code&gt;atomic-algolia&lt;/code&gt; 上传到 Algolia，页面上的搜索框直接请求 Algolia 的接口。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>hugo添加Algolia搜索系统</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/hugo-loveit-algolia/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/hugo-loveit-algolia/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/hugo/">Hugo</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="1-注册-algolia"&gt;&lt;span&gt;1. 注册 Algolia&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#1-%e6%b3%a8%e5%86%8c-algolia" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;注册 &lt;a href="https://www.algolia.com/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;algolia&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;添加索引 data sources&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;点击 Settings -&amp;gt; API Keys，查看自己的 Application ID 和 Search-Only API Key&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="2-生成索引文件"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2. 生成索引文件&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#2-%e7%94%9f%e6%88%90%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;修改 config.toml&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;注意 outputs 下面 home 的末尾要有&amp;quot;Algolia&amp;quot;，漏了生成的名字就不一样了&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>